WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Linda Park: This cycle's audit will focus heavily on document control and training records.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Theo Marsh: Are we including the new Station 7 work instruction in scope?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Linda Park: Yes, since it was recently revised it's a good candidate for the audit sample.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Carlos Ibarra: I'll make sure the retraining records for that station are ready for the auditors.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Linda Park: Let's finalize the audit schedule and auditee list by Friday.
